  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Caribbean Disaster Emergency Management Agency (CDEMA) Emergency Response Teams</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project will support the provision of emergency response assistance to Caribbean Disaster Emergency Management Agency Participating States affected by any hazard where the impact is at a Level 2 or Level 3 The support includes: Deployment of response teams,Logistics support, and Emergency communications support.</narrative>
